erse) (in vision); of vineyard Num 22:25 (twice in verse) (J), of city 35:4 (P), compare ׳ק חַחוֺמָה Josh 2:15 (JE) the (inner) surface of the wall. 3 more Generally, 1Kin 5:13 , and (in phrase בְּקִיר מַשְׁתִּין ) 1Sam 25:22 , 34 ; 1Kin 14:10 ; 16:11 ; 21:21 ; 2Kin 9:8 ; in figure Ezek 13:12 , 14 (apparently feminine, but city Jerusalem probably in mind, compare Albr ZAW xvi (1896), 85 Kö ff. 2, 175), 13:15 ; 13:15 (|| חַיִץ 13:10 , ׳ק נָטוּי Psa 62:4 ; אֶבֶן 2Sam 5:11 = ׳ק 1Chr 14:1 , compare Hab 2:11 (figurative); בַּדְוֶל קִיר Ezek 4:3 (symbolic). — Isa 22:5 is dubious: usually wall (so even Du Che Hpt Marti), but reference not clear; Ew Che comm.. III. קִיר Klo Brd Wkl Alttest. Unters. 177 קוֺע , so WMM Hast. DB KIR , but see Dr ib.KOA. 4 of flat side of altar Ezek 41:22 ; Exod 30:3 ; 37:26 ; Lev 1:15 ; 5:9 (all P). 5 לִכִּי קִירוֺת Jer 4:19 walls of my heart (as seat of pain).","rootNote":"or קִר ; (Isaiah 22:5), or (feminine) קִירָה ; from 6979 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 14 1","keyReferences":["1Chr 14 1","1Chr 29 4","1Kgs 5 13","1Kgs 6 5","1Kgs 6 5","1Kgs 6 6","1Kgs 6 15","1Kgs 6 15"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":74,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 14 1","book":"1Chr","chapter":14,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"קִ֔יר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 29 4","book":"1Chr","chapter":29,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"קִיר֥וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpc"},{"reference":"1Kgs 5 13","book":"1Kgs","chapter":5,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בַּ/קִּ֑יר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HRd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 6 5","book":"1Kgs","chapter":6,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"קִ֨יר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"1Kgs 6 5","book":"1Kgs","chapter":6,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"קִיר֤וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpc"},{"reference":"1Kgs 6 6